---
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-[#ebebeb] bg-[#fafafa] py-12 text-[#4d4d4d]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Theory -->
      <div class="space-y-3 md:col-span-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#171717] text-white">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold">CM</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717]">Color Mixer</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#8f8f8f]">
          Realistic physical color mixing based on the Kubelka-Munk pigment absorption theory and Johannes Itten's Bauhaus RYB color wheel.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-[#a1a1a1]">
          © {new Date().getFullYear()} realcolormixer.com · Free for commercial use.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Core Tools -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#171717] uppercase">Tools</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs">
          <li>
            <a href="/mix" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#171717]">
              Real Color Mixer <span class="rounded bg-[#f2f2f2] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[#4d4d4d]">RYB / Pigments</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/color-wheel" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#171717]">
              Color Wheel Picker <span class="rounded bg-[#f2f2f2] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[#4d4d4d]">Itten / Bauhaus</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/mix" class="text-[#8f8f8f] transition-colors hover:text-[#171717]">
              Mezcla de Colores Online (ES)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/color-wheel" class="text-[#8f8f8f] transition-colors hover:text-[#171717]">
              Rueda de Color & Círculo Cromático
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Color Science & Modes -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#171717] uppercase">Color Science</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[#8f8f8f]">
          <li><span class="text-[#4d4d4d]">Kubelka-Munk (K/S):</span> Subtractive paint mixing</li>
          <li><span class="text-[#4d4d4d]">Itten 12-Hue RYB:</span> Traditional artist wheel</li>
          <li><span class="text-[#4d4d4d]">OKLCH & OKLab:</span> CSS Color Module 4</li>
          <li><span class="text-[#4d4d4d]">WCAG 2.1:</span> AA / AAA contrast validation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Competitive Advantage -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#171717] uppercase">Why Better than RGB</h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#8f8f8f]">
          Unlike standard digital color tools that blend RGB channels into muddy grey, Color Mixer simulates physical light absorption — giving you true vibrant greens when mixing blue and yellow.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-between border-t border-[#ebebeb] pt-6 text-[11px] text-[#8f8f8f] sm:flex-row">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>Designed with Geist Design System</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Built with Astro & Tailwind v4</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-2 flex gap-3 sm:mt-0">
        <span class="font-mono">realcolormixer.com</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

